175	/// Returns whether an item from remote compaction output should be preserved.
176	///
177	/// Called while processing the model-provided compacted transcript, before we
178	/// append fresh canonical context from the current session.
179	///
180	/// We drop:
181	/// - `developer` messages because remote output can include stale/duplicated
182	///   instruction content.
